{"synopsis":"Yu Jihan kamu tidak berguna\nDengan katakata kasar itu Yu Jihan anggota berdedikasi dari guild bergengsi Keroes dan elit Partai Kim Hyuntae tibatiba diusir Setelah tujuh tahun mengabdi dia hanya menerima pesangon sebesar 10 juta won Tapi Yu Jihan memiliki kemampuan unik  Sampling \nyang memungkinkan dia melihat probabilitas\nKemungkinan Persekutuan Sangat Menyenangkan berkembang menjadi serikat besar\n99\nAku pasti akan melampaui kalian semua","alternative_title":"The Exiled Hero, 파티에서 추방된 영웅이 너무 뛰어남","author":"Bluecliffe, GGULBEOM","artist":"Minsun","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"dc598c91-0008-478e-8529-e45094eec63f","number":"70","chapter":"70","title":"","date":"2025-09-17","released":"2025-09-17","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_70/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_70/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_70/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_70/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_70/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_70/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_70/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_70/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_70/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_70/10.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"5302c523-641f-44c5-922a-c2e577aa65ce","number":"69","chapter":"69","title":"","date":"2025-09-17","released":"2025-09-17","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_35771b08-5d9e-4633-af81-f61c1c581ccb/chapter_ch_69/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_3577